    "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate experienced a gross prior year reserve strengthening of GBP 20.0 million in 2020. This was calculated from the gross claims development triangle. The narrative text, however, reported a net surplus (release) of GBP 51.972 million related to the reassessment of net claims incurred for previous accident years. The prior year development was influenced by a mix of factors including adverse development from 2018 weather-related catastrophic events (Hurricanes Michael, Florence, California Wildfires) and COVID-19 losses on prior years of account, partially offset by favourable back year reserve releases in Casualty, Motor, Marine, and Energy classes, and benign claims experience in some areas.",
